## Article 18. Rights of a citizen when reviewing an application or complaint

```catala
declaration scope Article18CitizenRights:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealType content AppealType
  output rightToPresentArguments content YesNo
  output rightToParticipateInVerification content YesNo
  output rightToAccessMaterials content YesNo
  output rightToSubmitAdditionalMaterials content YesNo
  output rightToBePresentDuringReview content YesNo
  output rightToUseAttorney content YesNo
  output rightToWrittenResponse content YesNo
  output rightToRequestConfidentiality content YesNo
  output rightToDemandCompensation content YesNo

scope Article18CitizenRights:
  label present_arguments definition rightToPresentArguments equals Yes

  label participate_verification definition rightToParticipateInVerification equals Yes

  label access_materials definition rightToAccessMaterials equals Yes

  label submit_materials definition rightToSubmitAdditionalMaterials equals Yes

  label be_present definition rightToBePresentDuringReview equals Yes

  label use_attorney definition rightToUseAttorney equals Yes

  label written_response definition rightToWrittenResponse equals Yes

  label request_confidentiality definition rightToRequestConfidentiality equals Yes

  label demand_compensation definition rightToDemandCompensation equals Yes
```